WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Imagine the hour hand walking from three to four. At three o’clock, its journey starts at three.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Fifteen minutes pass. Watch the short hand move a little towards four. It does not stay still.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Thirty minutes pass. The short hand is now halfway from three to four. The hour is still three.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:43.000
At three forty-five, it is nearly at four. But it has not reached four yet.

5
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Now it reaches four. Only now has the next hour started: four o’clock.

6
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Between two numbers, choose the hour the short hand has already passed.
